+# Circleback Read Client Implementation Plan
+> **For agentic workers:** Execute Task 4 only using Superpowers TDD.
+**Goal:** Bounded read-only meeting/transcript client.
+**Architecture:** Dedicated HttpClient; fixed HTTPS origin; token accessor called per request; trusted handler injection for fixtures only.
+**Tech Stack:** .NET8 System.Text.Json xUnit, no dependencies.
+**Spec:** ../specs/2026-10-28-unified-capabilities-design.md
+## Global Constraints
+No accounts, key creation, media, mutations, UI, configuration or integration edits.
+## Review Focus
+Redirects disabled; pagination exact origin/path validated before token access; opaque cursor preserved; bounded streams without Content-Length; cancellation and sanitized errors.
+## Files and interfaces
+Providers/Circleback/CirclebackModels.cs: typed DTOs, provenance, error.
+Providers/Circleback/CirclebackClient.cs: sealed IDisposable.
+Core.Tests/Circleback/CirclebackClientTests.cs: fixture transport tests.
+Constructor: CirclebackClient(Func<CancellationToken, ValueTask<string?>> tokenAccessor, HttpMessageHandler? handler = null, int maxResponseBytes = 4194304).
+Methods: Task<CirclebackMeetingPage> ListMeetingsAsync(Uri? nextPage = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default); Task<CirclebackMeetingResult> GetMeetingAsync(string meetingId, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default); Task<CirclebackTranscriptResult> GetTranscriptAsync(string meetingId, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default); void Dispose().
+Limits: default4MiB, allowed1..16MiB;10000 entries; JSON depth32; ID1..256 ASCII alphanumeric/underscore/hyphen; link8192. No automatic pagination/retry. Provider notes/privateNotes/actions are untrusted source content, not inferred facts.
+- [x] Write tests and observe RED.
+- [x] Implement exact DTO/transport contract; verify GREEN.
+- [x] Run focused and full Core, retain logs/exits in source report.
+- [x] Commit only owned files and exact plan/source documents.
